  ultimateText: "\u0110\u01B0\u01A1ng D\u01B0\u01A1ng Ki\u1EC1u H\u1ED1ng: d\u1EADm
    ch\xE2n g\u1EA7m \u2014 qu\xE1i b\xE1n k\xEDnh 4 \u0103n \xD73, h\u1EA5t l\xF9i
    + cho\xE1ng 3s + ph\xE1 gi\xE1p 30%; \xF4ng khi\xEAu kh\xEDch c\u1EA3 v\xF9ng,
    \u221250% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng nh\u1EADn 6s. Boss ch\u1EC9 b\u1ECB ch\u1EADm
    + ph\xE1 gi\xE1p."
  passiveText: "K\u1EBFt Ngh\u0129a (nh\u01B0 L\u01B0u B\u1ECB). V\u1EA1n Nh\xE2n
    \u0110\u1ECBch: m\u1ED7i qu\xE1i quanh \xF4ng \u22126% s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
    nh\u1EADn (t\u1ED1i \u0111a 30%)."
  minorText: "B\xE1t X\xE0 M\xE2u: xoay x\xE0 m\xE2u n\u1EA1p l\u1EF1c r\u1ED3i \u0111\xE2m
    xuy\xEAn 2 \xF4, qu\xE1i tr\xFAng b\u1ECB ph\xE1 gi\xE1p 15% trong 4s."
  secondMinorText: "T\xFAy T\u1EEDu: m\xE1u d\u01B0\u1EDBi 60% th\xEC tu b\u1EA7u
    r\u01B0\u1EE3u \u2014 h\u1ED3i 20% m\xE1u, mi\u1EC5n cho\xE1ng, \u221230% s\xE1t
    th\u01B0\u01A1ng nh\u1EADn 5s."
